## Bar (what would have been scored)
Academy header (DINNER.oot:23-32, dinner_lint.oo:33-44, SCRIPTING.oot:34-47)
  Line 1: `// # <Title>`
  `// Logline: <one sentence, present tense, ends in a period>.`
  `// Setup: <preconditions>.`
  `// Beats:` then 3-6 numbered beats.

when / and / then are comments, not live tokens (SCRIPTING.oot:22; SPRINT B7 parse fix)
  Live: `^\s*(when|and|then)\b` as IDENT (lex_comment.oo only eats `//`).
  Pass: `// when` / `// and` / `// then` only.

No import of .oo
  Fail: `import "...oo"`.
  Running a leftover .oo via process_exec is a residual, not this import check.

main takes caps
  Pass: `pub fn main(p: &ProcessCap, ...)` (and other injected caps).
  Fail: `pub fn main()` with no cap args. Do not mint caps; take them.

